{"id":"bf22a31223b8fa24","group":"28","path":"28/28-prop-xor-lower-bound-largeness.md","title":"单函数 XOR 下界向半数函数传播","display":"prop-xor-lower-bound-largeness — 单函数 XOR 下界向半数函数传播","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-prop-xor-lower-bound-largeness","aliases":["28-prop-xor-lower-bound-largeness"],"display":"prop-xor-lower-bound-largeness — 单函数 XOR 下界向半数函数传播","depends_on":["[[28-df-boolean-circuit]]","[[28-df-circuit-size]]"],"source_book_location":"§23.2.2","source_printed_pages":"501","source_pdf_pages":"527","source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization","source_proof_reviewed":false,"local_proof_reviewed":true,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision":"R5","verification_status":"proved-in-note; source-statement-compared"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-prop-xor-lower-bound-largeness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-prop-xor-lower-bound-largeness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-xor-lower-bound-largeness — 单函数 XOR 下界向半数函数传播"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7776a98a623ada8d\" href=\"?note=7776a98a623ada8d\" title=\"28-df-boolean-circuit\">28-df-boolean-circuit</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"14f69cc09dc02600\" href=\"?note=14f69cc09dc02600\" title=\"28-df-circuit-size\">28-df-circuit-size</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book_location","html":"§23.2.2"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"501"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"527"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"local_proof_reviewed","html":"true"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision","html":"R5"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note; source-statement-compared"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B_n=\\{f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\\}\">\\(\\mathcal B_n=\\{f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\\}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,1},\\operatorname{BF},\\operatorname{out}_C\">\\(\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,1},\\operatorname{BF},\\operatorname{out}_C\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7776a98a623ada8d\" href=\"?note=7776a98a623ada8d\" title=\"28-df-boolean-circuit\">28-df-boolean-circuit</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{size}\">\\(\\operatorname{size}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"14f69cc09dc02600\" href=\"?note=14f69cc09dc02600\" title=\"28-df-circuit-size\">28-df-circuit-size</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathcal B_n\">\\(f\\in\\mathcal B_n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\in\\mathbb R_{\\ge6}\">\\(S\\in\\mathbb R_{\\ge6}\\)</span>；XOR 逐点计算。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"K_n(g)\\coloneqq\\min\\{\\operatorname{size}(C):C\\in\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,1}\\land\\operatorname{BF}(C)\\land\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;\\operatorname{out}_C(x)_1=g(x)\\}\\qquad(g\\in\\mathcal B_n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[K_n(g)\\coloneqq\\min\\{\\operatorname{size}(C):C\\in\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,1}\\land\\operatorname{BF}(C)\\land\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;\\operatorname{out}_C(x)_1=g(x)\\}\\qquad(g\\in\\mathcal B_n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"K_n(f)\\ge S\\Longrightarrow\\frac{|\\{g\\in\\mathcal B_n:K_n(g)\\ge(S-5)/2\\}|}{2^{2^n}}\\ge\\frac12.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[K_n(f)\\ge S\\Longrightarrow\\frac{|\\{g\\in\\mathcal B_n:K_n(g)\\ge(S-5)/2\\}|}{2^{2^n}}\\ge\\frac12.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>最小值存在，因为有限 DNF 可精确计算任何 g。XOR 可用两个 NOT、两个 AND、一个 OR 的五个门构造，所以 K(f)≤K(g)+K(f⊕g)+5。若小于 (S−5)/2 的函数比例超过一半，则均匀 g 与 f⊕g 同时属于此集合有正概率，推出 K(f)&lt;S。原书以安全冗余常数 10 叙述，本地五门模型给更精确界，显式记录此实现差异。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 Arora–Barak PDF，§23.2.2；印刷页 501；PDF 页 527。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-boolean-circuit","status":"resolved","id":"7776a98a623ada8d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-boolean-circuit]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-circuit-size","status":"resolved","id":"14f69cc09dc02600","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-circuit-size]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-boolean-circuit","status":"resolved","id":"7776a98a623ada8d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$，$\\mathcal B_n=\\{f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\\}$。$\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,1},\\operatorname{BF},\\operatorname{out}_C$ 见 [[28-df-boolean-circuit]]，$\\operatorname{size}$ 见 [[28-df-circuit-size]]。$f\\in\\mathcal B_n$，$S\\in\\mathbb R_{\\ge6}$；XOR 逐点计算。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-circuit-size","status":"resolved","id":"14f69cc09dc02600","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$，$\\mathcal B_n=\\{f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\\}$。$\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,1},\\operatorname{BF},\\operatorname{out}_C$ 见 [[28-df-boolean-circuit]]，$\\operatorname{size}$ 见 [[28-df-circuit-size]]。$f\\in\\mathcal B_n$，$S\\in\\mathbb R_{\\ge6}$；XOR 逐点计算。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B_n=\\{f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,1},\\operatorname{BF},\\operatorname{out}_C","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{size}","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathcal B_n","display":false},{"tex":"S\\in\\mathbb R_{\\ge6}","display":false},{"tex":"K_n(g)\\coloneqq\\min\\{\\operatorname{size}(C):C\\in\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,1}\\land\\operatorname{BF}(C)\\land\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;\\operatorname{out}_C(x)_1=g(x)\\}\\qquad(g\\in\\mathcal B_n).","display":true},{"tex":"K_n(f)\\ge S\\Longrightarrow\\frac{|\\{g\\in\\mathcal B_n:K_n(g)\\ge(S-5)/2\\}|}{2^{2^n}}\\ge\\frac12.","display":true}],"bytes":1827,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-418","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-formal-complexity-measure]]、[[28-thm-formal-measure-formula-bound]]、[[28-lem-formal-measure-quarter-large]]、[[28-thm-formal-measure-almost-everywhere]]、[[28-df-promise-problem]]、[[28-df-promise-ma]]、[[28-df-promise-circuit-size]]、[[28-thm-promise-ma-fixed-polynomial-lower-bound]]、[[28-prop-xor-lower-bound-largeness]]、[[28-ex-singleton-property-not-large]]。"}],"outgoing":["7776a98a623ada8d","14f69cc09dc02600"]}